'''Honey Trap (Deadly)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]] and appears on the '''1st''', '''2nd''', '''15th''', and '''16th''' of every month. When clearing the stage, there is a chance to unlock [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Little Leaguer Cat]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is a permanent unlockable stage once beating [[Heavenly Tower]] [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 10|Floor 10]].

