'''Battle''': Lure Queen B to the base, then start stacking Cameraman, Sadako, Butterfly, and Can Can on her. After the first damage knockback, send Bahamut out. The Freeze from your units will prevent Queen B from attacking, allowing you to send other units without being punished by Queen B's Slow, while Magica's Weaken can allow Bahamut to tank a hit.

