'''Battle:''' Try to get some levels onto Courier for this strategy to work better, preferably to one of the breakthrough points mentioned earlier in this page.

Because Brollows don't appear until THE SLOTH attacks for the second time, you can use this opportunity to simply stall for cash using Cleanerbot Cat and Courier Cats. Just send both out as soon as Queen B. spawns, which should prevent Courier Cat from getting sniped by THE SLOTH. By the time Cleanerbot Cat dies, you can start spamming the rest of your meatshields, since by that point, you will have a level 3 or 4 Worker Cat. If you find yourself running out of cash, try to prioritize sending out Crazed Cat, Catellite, and Courier, since Crazed Tank, especially if underleveled, doesn't do anything better than Crazed Cat. Mistiming Courier isn't too big of a deal, since he is likely to sprint into Queen B's blind spot once his Slow wears off. Just spam your meatshields and time Couriers well for an easy victory.

