|Island Cat
|Manic Lion Cat|40
|Awakened Bahamut Cat|40
|talent5 = Explosion Lv. 10
|name = Lineup 1
|notes = Manic Lion Cat needs to be at least Lv. 37 to survive an attack from THE SLOTH with a Defense Up [[Cat Combo]].
}}

'''Difficulty:''' ★★☆☆☆

'''Battle:''' Wait until you've saved up 4,500¢, then spawn a Manic Lion Cat followed by Awakened Bahamut Cat once you have enough cash. Moby Dick gives Bahamut enough health to survive one hit from THE SLOTH, while the Manic Lion Cats act as meatshields to protect Bahamut from the Kroxos/Brollows. Simply time your Manic Lion Cats so that they aren't sniped by Queen B, and victory should be yours. Do note that while this strategy is mostly consistent, unlucky Kroxo/Brollow spawn patterns can inadvertently brick certain runs on occasion.

