==Trivia==
*A "honey trap" is a strategy which involves using an attractive person to lure the victim into a false relationship, matching Queen B's theme of lust as one of the seven deadly sins.
*Honey Trap was added in the same update as [[Strike Unit R.E.I. (Uber Rare Cat)|Strike Unit R.E.I.]], [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]], as though it was designed specifically for her to counter.
*The enemy base's HP is fully composed of 7s, which are believed to be lucky in many cultures.
*This stage was added to The Battle Cats Unite! on the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update#March 15, 2024 Update Patch|March 15, 2024 Update Patch]].

